! (OAT) parameter_L/parameter_H runs will be initialized from, per
! MMPPE-info/MMPPE.md ("One-At-a-Time Test": "first perform a 3-month spin-up
! of the default CTL run, then initialize all OAT runs from this same CTL
! state").
!
! Scope: ONLY the CESM/CAM equivalents identified so far for the 14 OAT
! "Variables to test" (MMPPE.md, One-At-a-Time Test section) -- see
! MMPPE-info/OAT_variable_mapping.txt for the full derivation/caveats behind
! every field listed below. empty_htapes=.true. below turns off ALL default
! CAM history output (the usual AMWG-default field set), so history file h0
! contains ONLY the fields explicitly listed in fincl1.
!
! Frequency: daily average. Not specified by MMPPE.md for the CTL spin-up
! itself (only the later 5-day OAT runs have an explicit "5-day global-mean"
! requirement); daily is a reasonable default for a 3-month spin-up and keeps
! file sizes/count manageable. Revisit if a different cadence turns out to be
! needed once the OAT run's own output requirements are finalized.
!
! NOT final: this covers only the OAT "Variables to test" list. The fuller
! "Model Output Variables" tables in MMPPE.md (6-hourly instantaneous +
! monthly mean) are mapped in MMPPE-info/6hourly_variable_mapping.txt and
! monthly_mean_variable_mapping.txt but not yet incorporated here -- more
! fincl/nhtfrq/mfilt entries (likely additional history file streams, e.g.
! fincl2/nhtfrq(2) for a 6-hourly tape) will be added as that output gets
! finalized. Some PPE-tunable parameters are also still unimplemented (see
! ppe_changes_incorporated.txt, "Not yet done") -- this file only controls
! CTL *output*, not which knobs get perturbed in the later OAT runs.
!===============================================================================

